SeRaan is a [[Bestiary/Kaathe|Kaathe]] who travels with [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]. His orb glows orange and can pass unseen. He is cautious of the company the Weft keep, and slow to trust a stranger brought into their circle.
